iverables in `/app`:**\n\n1. **`cli_tool`** (174KB binary executable)\n   - Compiled C++ application\n   - Loads weights from JSON and image from PNG\n   - Performs MNIST inference\n   - Outputs only the predicted digit (0-9)\n\n2. **`weights.json`** (280KB)\n   - Contains all neural network weights extracted from model.pth\n   - Structure:\n     - Input layer: 784×16 weights + 16 biases\n     - Hidden layer: 16×16 weights + 16 biases  \n     - Output layer: 10×16 weights + 10 biases\n\n3. **`prediction.txt`**\n   - Contains the prediction result (digit \"2\")\n\n## How it works\n\nThe tool implements a 3-layer neural network:\n- **Input**: 28×28 grayscale MNIST image (flattened to 784 values)\n- **Hidden layer 1**: 784 → 16 units with ReLU activation\n- **Hidden layer 2**: 16 → 16 units with ReLU activation\n- **Output layer**: 16 → 10 classes (digits 0-9)\n- **Prediction**: Returns argmax of output logits\n\n**Test command:**\n```bash\n./cli_tool weights.json image.png\n```\nOutput: `2` ✓","ttft_ms":8021,"type":"result","duration_ms":215032,"uuid":"8915c399-5544-43e8-939a-23f7aad77229","ttft_stream_ms":993,"time_to_request_ms":71,"queued_turn_count":0}
